## 待审文本（按字段）
{
 "reply": "Hi [Buyer Name],\n\nThank you for your inquiry about our 4.5L air fryer. Here are answers to each of your questions.\n\n1. Certifications (FCC & ETL)\nOur 4.5L model holds [FCC certificate/report No. ___] and [ETL listing No. ___], issued by [testing lab]. I can send you copies of both today so your team can verify them before you order. Since these certifications are for the North American market, the unit runs on 120V/60Hz with a US plug.\n\n2. PTFE-free basket\nWe offer two PTFE-free options for this model:\n- Ceramic-coated basket: non-stick, easy to clean, and the most popular choice with US retailers\n- Stainless steel basket: very durable and fully coating-free\nBoth are food-contact safe, and we can provide [FDA / LFGB] test reports.\n\n3. Price for 800 units, FOB [Port]\n- Standard version: USD [__]/unit\n- Ceramic-coated PTFE-free basket: USD [__]/unit\n- Stainless steel basket: USD [__]/unit\nI understand your target is USD 20. If we [adjust the color box packaging / simplify the accessories / use our standard housing color], we can bring the PTFE-free version to USD [__], close to your target. I'm happy to work through these options with you.\n\n4. Delivery\nWe can ship within [__] days after we receive your deposit and you confirm the artwork. Keeping a standard color and simple logo printing makes a 30-day schedule easier to meet. If your timeline is tight, I can reserve production capacity for your order now.\n\nTo send you an exact quotation, could you please confirm:\n- Which basket type you prefer (ceramic or stainless steel)\n- Housing color, and whether you need your logo on the unit or packaging\n- Packaging requirements (color box, retail-ready, Amazon FBA labeling, etc.)\n- Your preferred payment terms\n\nWe can also send a pre-production sample so you can check quality before placing the order. If it helps, I'm available for a quick video call to show you the product and our factory.\n\nI look forward to working with you on this order.\n\nBest regards,\n[Your Name]\n[Company Name]\nWhatsApp/WeChat: [__]\nEmail: [__]"
}
